    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">People living with disabilities, impairments, and/or functional limitations related to terminal or chronic illness/disease, whether apparent or not, and permanent, temporary or episodic in nature, that hinders their full and. equal participation in society when they face a barrier.</skos:definition>
